{"parse": {"title": "DAU-06", "pageid": 40839, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/DAU-05\" title=\"DAU-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">DAU-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/DAU-07\" title=\"DAU-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">DAU</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.9C.9F.E5.AE.9E.E4.B8.96.E7.95.8C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"真实世界\">真实世界</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 真实世界</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Reality</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1860106</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有事情都想兼顾的后果就是，命名日没来得及在维拉进门之前收起任何应该掩盖的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>打字机仍然根据电报的节奏敲下明文字节，只要维拉再走近两步，就能看清上面的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>那是什么？命名日先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>电报和打字机……是来自来亚什基的回信吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>但我记得，小镇的收发室已经废弃很久了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>这到底是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>不，这是、呃，这是我哥给我的信！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>虽然我不会责怪您，但您确实打扰了一个比较私密的时刻——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>维拉眯起了眼睛，金色的光似乎在她瞳孔里隐约浮现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鲁萨尔卡拥有异于常人的身体素质，其中包含了极佳的视力。<br />换句话说，她甚至不用故意去读那些字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>……“您最忠诚的，也最坏的朋友”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“北方哨歌”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>虽然，我也不会“责怪”你，但是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>你的哥哥叫北方哨歌？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>……不……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>不是那样的，维拉女士。我只是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我知道，我知道。这只是个玩笑，你不必紧张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>可以让我看看她写了什么吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>您——或许您还是不要看了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>哦，对！基金会收到的消息，包括信件，都要先经过一套内部审核流程！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>北方哨歌女士的这份，由于我还在转码当中，还没有走过这个流程……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>属于书报审查机构的时代已经过去了，先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>为什么还要这样紧张呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>这只是一个朋友的回信而已，它能有怎样激进的内容呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>您瞧，它还“紧紧地握您的手”。多么友好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当最后一缕报点的电波声消失在房间的灰尘之中，打字机也逐渐放缓了速度，直到敲尽最后一个字符。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们的沟通也几乎陷入同样的停滞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>如果……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>如果您实在要看，那您就看吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>毕竟，这是您的信件，和您的自由……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A:%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6&amp;wpDestFile=Cg-1_8_fugudaziji_quan.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"文件:Cg-1 8 fugudaziji quan.png\">1_8_fugudaziji_quan</a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“北方哨歌” ：</div><div>很高兴终于收到了您的信！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“北方哨歌” ：</div><div>一开始我忐忑于拆开它，害怕得到什么更坏的消息。毕竟这些日子里，几乎只有这家伙与我们同进同出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“北方哨歌” ：</div><div>所以，当我终于做好准备，坐下来一口气将它看完之后……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“北方哨歌” ：</div><div>我立刻就给您发了这封电报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“北方哨歌” ：</div><div>首先，您和您那些勇敢的小战士们都很好，这几乎是连日的坏事以来最令我感到宽慰的消息了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“北方哨歌” ：</div><div>但信中您表现出的个人状况，却实在令我疑惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“北方哨歌” ：</div><div>您决定回去！可您难道不知道吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“北方哨歌” ：</div><div>您不知道要回去的来亚什基，已经不是您所知、且为之拼命和奋斗过的地方了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“北方哨歌” ：</div><div>您不知道，因为“暴雨”，来亚什基的一切都改变了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“北方哨歌” ：</div><div>我猜，或许是基金会选择了对您隐瞒真相。他们这样做一定有着自己的考量，但我仅作为一个朋友，是需要将真实情况和盘托出的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“北方哨歌” ：</div><div>就我所知，“暴雨”这一现象导致的混乱持续了很长时间。不管是地点，还是生活在那地方的人，经过它的摧残之后，都只会被“回溯”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“北方哨歌” ：</div><div>而“回溯”，只不过是凭空消失的另一种说法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“北方哨歌” ：</div><div>我还没有回去过小镇，但我去过其他曾经熟悉的地方。我亲眼看见……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“北方哨歌” ：</div><div>试想一下，您熟知的大多数人都消失了，欣欣向荣的小镇变成了一片荒芜？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-307720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“北方哨歌” ：</div><div>这并不是在恐吓您，只是描述一种在“暴雨”之后，最常见的可能情况……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-308714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-308714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-308714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“暴雨”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一个维拉曾经听过的词。于是这时的视线也自然投向最先使她知晓的那个人。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>原来这才是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>真正的“暴雨”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>对吗？命名日先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>……其实、其实“暴雨”并没有北方哨歌女士描述的这么严重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>您瞧，您和阿夫西维他们，呆在基金会里，也没有受到什么伤害。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>没有消失，没有“回溯”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说到最后一个词，命名日的声音几乎是被他自己吞进了喉咙里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他驱使不了更多语言为他所用，甚至无法为这一刻“命名”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>要我说，其实只是外面变得很不一样了，对不对？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>维拉拍了拍年轻人的肩膀。由于身高的差距，她还需要轻轻踮起脚来，才好准确做到这个动作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>……是很不一样。但，也没有信里说的那样，只剩下恐慌和混乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>唉，我不是想说这个。就算这样，您也不考虑留在基金会吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小男孩沉思时也会发出一阵子仿佛嘟囔的声音，这动静在此处是这样不同寻常，以至于两个成年人都因此回过头去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>阿夫西维？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>……阿夫西维同学？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>你是什么时候进来的？而且，你拿着，呃，什么东西？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩举起手中的信封，像高高举起一面旗帜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>维拉，你看，这里有好多“永恒的灵魂”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>你是来找它们的对不对？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>这是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有寄出的信件安静地伫立于角落，如金币堆叠，等待着被寻宝者发现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小小的男孩站在它们面前，懵懂而惊讶地瞧着手中的“战利品”之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>哦，上面被涂了黑色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>不过没关系，帕索诺可以用它们来折有黑色斑点的海燕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>所有的这些——这些，这些，和这些！都可以利用起来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>帕索诺和尼娜一定会很开心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>现在，我宣布你们都是“永恒的灵魂”了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>阿夫西维同学……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>这不是什么，“永恒的灵魂”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>没关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>阿夫西维同志说得一点儿也没错，命名日先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>如果我们觉得这是“永恒的灵魂”，那它就可以是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>这没什么讲究。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>更何况现在它们也没有其他用处了，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>……抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>不必道歉。我说过了，你有你的工作要做，而我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>即使是现在，我也有我需要做的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>……呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>还好你没有把它们寄出去。这样，孩子们就有新的折纸可以用了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "含有受损文件链接的页面"}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "DAU-06"}}